------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope and architecture
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does NOT include, redistribute, modify, or derive any part
of Anthropic's proprietary Claude Desktop binary or source code. The
launcher operates by invoking a user's existing, independently obtained
Claude Desktop installation via standard command-line arguments
(--user-data-dir and --profile) that are features of the underlying
Chromium / Electron runtime, not Anthropic-specific APIs.

The optional profile shim under `shim/` is an original work by this
project's contributors that an END USER may elect to install into their
own copy of Claude Desktop on their own machine. The shim's source is
MIT-licensed and contains no Anthropic code.

