------------------------------------------------------------------------
Security scope
------------------------------------------------------------------------

- The launcher reads and writes only files inside its own installation
  directory, plus the user-chosen Claude Desktop profile directories.
- The optional "Who is signed in?" feature performs ONE HTTPS request to
  `api.anthropic.com/api/oauth/profile` using the local user's own,
  already-signed-in OAuth access token, and shows the response in the
  UI. No token, email, or other identifying data is ever sent to any
  other host.
- See SECURITY.md for how to report vulnerabilities.
